sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Nijhout (1990) & Brakefield et al. (1996) butterfly wing-vein focus determination and concentric French-flag eyespot ring morphogenesis — MorphoEval overall 47.7/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2001-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings.py` (consensus score 51.5/100). The v1 script plots only a 1D analytical exponential decay curve and a 2D circular disc sketch for a single parameter set, omitting Stage-1 2D Meinhardt wing-compartment vein-boundary reaction-diffusion focus determination (Nijhout 1990), Stage-2 2D focal diffusion-decay PDE relaxation, seasonal ecdysone polyphenism (wet vs dry season), *Goldeneye* Spalt-threshold shift, twin-focus hourglass fusion, pupal focal microcautery timing series, runtime SHA-256 dataset verification, and CV radial luminance/chroma ring segmentation on the vendored *Bicyclus anynana* ventral wing eyespot specimen photograph. Overall 47.7/100 (faithfulness 40.4, reproducibility 64.5); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit HEAD; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 52, Morphological realism / specimen match 24, Parameter expressivity 44, Morphometric validation 50, Source and data traceability 64, Code-to-model traceability 60, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/butterfly_eyespot_focus_rings_comparison.png: rendered output of 2001-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings.py at HEAD, image/png, 79032 B, 1400×588 px, artifact_sha256 6ecb6d8e0b918529a896cdbe3567e958ca7f94bdb3dfb0c94623949819152591 (sha256 6ecb6d8e0b918529a896cdbe3567e958ca7f94bdb3dfb0c94623949819152591), spec_fingerprint 0a2086f2436043ce9998603ef36e23feb6c621834d7d960a99310b296156772b. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 0a2086f2436043ce9998603ef36e23feb6c621834d7d960a99310b296156772b; artifact_sha256: 6ecb6d8e0b918529a896cdbe3567e958ca7f94bdb3dfb0c94623949819152591; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/butterfly_eyespot_focus_rings/bicyclus_anynana_eyespot_specimen.jpg=f1826cee44602782..., datasets/butterfly_eyespot_focus_rings/butterfly_eyespot_focus_rings_reference.json=b19590626bdaff79..., datasets/butterfly_eyespot_focus_rings/scout_manifest.json=7cfe9d2221ea5b8b...}." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Expose full CLI parameter overrides (`--c0`, `--lambda-mm`, `--theta-black`, `--theta-gold`, `--d12`, `--seed`, `--skip-gif`), upgrade `self_test()` to an 8-point verification suite with bitwise two-run determinism, and render a 6-panel publication-grade synthesis figure and co-evolving 2-panel Stage-1 focus + Stage-2 concentric ring morphogenesis GIF.",
            "remediation needed: Implement the coupled two-stage 2D morphogenesis pipeline: Stage-1 2D Meinhardt activator-inhibitor reaction-diffusion inside a longitudinal wing-vein-bounded cell compartment [0, L_x] x [-W_y/2, W_y/2] that destabilizes the midline ridge into a discrete focal organizer at (x_f, 0) (Nijhout 1990), coupled to Stage-2 2D focal morphogen diffusion-decay and Spalt/Engrailed/Distal-less concentric ring induction across all 5 experimental regimes (Wet-Season Wild-Type, Dry-Season Polyphenism, Goldeneye Spalt-shift mutant, Twin-Focus Hourglass Fusion, and Early Pupal Focal Microcautery Ablation) plus the 6-point pupal cautery timing series.",
            "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/butterfly_eyespot_focus_rings/` at runtime and perform computer-vision Difference-of-Gaussians focus detection and radial luminance + golden-chroma concentric ring segmentation (`segment_bicyclus_eyespot_specimen`) on `bicyclus_anynana_eyespot_specimen.jpg`, measuring primary Cu1 focus coordinates (596, 231), pupil radius R_pupil = 3.663 px, black core radius R_black = 15.442 px, outer gold radius R_gold = 20.402 px, and black-to-gold ratio 0.7569." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.477"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (Pass 1 baseline assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

